@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+---
+id: task-004-add-hourly-equipment-rentals
+type: task
+title: "Add hourly equipment rentals"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Added optional integer-cent `hourlyPrice` support to equipment. Rentals shorter than 24 hours now
+accept exact UTC-hour boundaries and charge once per elapsed hour; an item without an hourly price is
+rejected for such a rental. Whole-day pricing and long-rental discounts are unchanged.
+
+Updated availability and overlap handling to support the same hourly boundaries, documented the public
+contract, and added deterministic tests for hourly quote/booking, unavailable hourly pricing, invalid
+hourly periods, and adjacent hourly availability. `npm test` passes.
